---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import collage4 from "../assets/images/collages/collage4.png";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="A Poem">
    <article class="story">
        <div class="img-wrapper">
            <Image
                src={collage4}
                alt="Fly, my dear, but beware of gravity."
                class="flip-img hoverable"
            />
        </div>
        <pre
            id="poem">
Now and then it comes to me -
This secret flower of mythology -
Half entwined with long grapevines
That sit and weep their golden wines
Crucify me then -
No more is this flesh mine,
It has been consumed and baptized
In a world without order it rises
Faithless in a time medieval
<a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/monologue"}>I speak to myself</a>
        </pre>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    article.story {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .flip-img {
        max-width: 30rem;
        height: auto;
    }

    #postcard {
        padding: 1em;
        display: flex;
        width: 45rem;
        height: 30rem;
        background-image: url(../assets/images/paper_texture.avif);
        background-size: 40%;
    }

    #postcard__left {
        display: flex;
        height: 100%;
        padding: 1em;
        gap: 2rem;
        /* border-right: 1px solid rgb(39, 39, 39); */
    }

    #postcard__left::after {
        content: "";
        display: block;
        width: 8px;
        height: 100%;
        background-image: url(../assets/images/wave.png);
        background-size: contain;
        /* border-right: 1px solid; */
    }

    #postcard__right {
        width: 100%;
    }

    #stamp {
        margin: 1em 1em 0 auto;
        width: 4rem;
        height: 5rem;
        border: 1px solid;
    }
</style>
